    "ノルマの枚数を取れば勝ち" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Win by taking the goal number of cards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ノルマは無く、札が尽きるか、どちらかが続けられなくなるまで続きます。札を取ると空いた場所に山札から新しい札が出ます（山札が尽きたら出ません）。盤と山札の札を全部なくすとパーフェクトで勝ち。時間切れは負けです" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There's no goal. Play goes on until the cards run out or someone can't continue. When a card is taken, a new one from the stock fills the gap (until the stock runs out). Clear every card on the board and in the stock for a perfect win. Running out of time is a loss."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ノルマ達成" : {
